SCRAMBLE   ALIEN   CONFIG (1.0)
  ROOTCAT   S.
  FILES  .
  LEXENTRIES   (SCRAMBLE ALIEN).
  TEMPLATES  (SCRAMBLE ALIEN).
  RULES   (SCRAMBLE ALIEN).
  GOVERNABLERELATIONS    SUBJ OBJ OBJ2 COMP XCOMP OBL OBL-?+.
  SEMANTICFUNCTIONS    ADJUNCT  TOPIC FOCUS POSS STANDARD.
  NONDISTRIBUTIVES    NUM PERS CONJ-FORM.
  EPSILON   e.
  OPTIMALITYORDER NOGOOD.

----
SCRAMBLE ALIEN RULES (1.0)

"The comma between NP* and PP* is the SHUFFLE OPERATOR"
S --> NP*: @GF ,
      PP*: @GF ;
      V: ^=! .

NP --> N: ^=! .

PP --> P: ^=! ;
       NP: (^ OBJ) = ! .

----
SCRAMBLE ALIEN TEMPLATES (1.0)

"The GF Macro tests all possible garmmatical functions for the scrambled words"
GF = { (^ SUBJ) = ! | (^ OBJ) = ! | (^ OBJ2) = ! | (^ OBL) = ! | ! $ (^ ADJUNCT) }.

----
SCRAMBLE ALIEN LEXICON (1.0)

"Nouns"
tam   N * (^ PRED) = 'garden'.
plim  N * (^ PRED) = 'gorilla'.
tipf  N * (^ PRED) = 'banana'.
bobo  N * (^ PRED) = 'baboon'.

"Verbs "
"Eat can optionally take an OBL for the location (in the garden)"
taotao V * { (^ PRED) = 'eat<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)>' 
           | (^ PRED) = 'eat<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)(^ OBL)>' 
             (^ OBL PFORM) =c ya }.

"Give requires a giver, a gift, and a recipient"
guagua V * (^ PRED) = 'give<(^ SUBJ)(^ OBJ)(^ OBL)>'
           (^ OBL PFORM) =c di .

"Prepositions"

ya    P * (^ PFORM) = ya 
          (^ PRED) = 'ya<(^ OBJ)>' .

di    P * (^ PFORM) = di 
          (^ PRED) = 'di<(^ OBJ)>' .